### Books API

### GET public Books

GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books

### Get single book
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books/public/atomic-habits

### GET Books by admin
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books/admin
Authorization: bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImhvbXVnQGdtYWlsLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3NDc4NTg4NSwiZXhwIjoxNzc0Nzg2Nzg1fQ.I2avoDJT6mIAmIUk33fr1OupJaQT3tXKm8NCNx-tDQU

### Insert new book

POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImhvbXVnQGdtYWlsLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3NDY5MTcyNywiZXhwIjoxNzc0NjkyNjI3fQ.dz4wFs-Wi-kY0hWh6WlBePChiQfp2sLjSWJ0LwpNL74

{
    "title": "Theory of time",
    "year": 2025,
    "author": "Stephen Hawking",
    "imgUrl": "https://example.com/images/clean-code.jpg",
    "isbn": "1548584859",
