### UPDATE BOOKS

PUT {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImhvbXVnQGdtYWlsLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3NTczOTcxNSwiZXhwIjoxNzc1NzQwNjE1fQ.ifkJJuNb9TNmwl6EfZX9u3QUj5Sa2XZAWunpkKQcHQE

{
    "title": "Theory of time",
    "year": 2025,
    "author": "Stephen Hawking",
    "imgUrl": "https://example.com/images/clean-code.jpg",
    "isbn": "1548584859",
